      "semantics": "ACTION is the only external-state construct. The exact operation glossary entry supplies its complete ordered schema, required and optional fields, allowed value categories, result type, and canonical selection rule. Fields must appear once and in that entry's stated order; omitted optional fields have only the entry's stated default, otherwise no default exists. Unknown, duplicate, out-of-order, or type-incompatible fields are static errors. Source-location discovery uses op_find; possession-sensitive household manipulation requires op_pick_up or op_remove; requested generated text uses GENERATE, not ACTION.",
