      "semantics": "UTTER records a non-effectful symbolic request, answer, revision, or question and is legal only inside a TURN. Its intent entry supplies the exact ordered schema. The optional binding is the uttered PROPOSITION and can be referenced by later turns only through an explicit generated or conversational artifact reference mechanism; it never binds prose. A request for an answer, recipe, explanation, or script is represented by an intent proposition, while the requested artifact itself is represented by GENERATE.",
