      "semantics": "Check is pure and has fixed precedence OR, AND, NOT, comparison. Operands are only closed Types & Lexicon values. NUMBER supports all comparisons; BOOL, ENTITY, ROLE, VALUE, PROPOSITION, CODE, REF, and LIST support only equality and inequality unless their exact glossary entry explicitly defines an ordering relation. Proposition equality compares intent symbol and ordered field sequence recursively. No text, unbound name, or undeclared ontology symbol can be tested.",
