quantifier ::= (ANY | ALL) HANDLE IN iterable SATISFIES check` — FOR EACH, ANY, and ALL operate only on finite LIST[T] values. Their introduced names are handles, scoped to one loop body or quantifier check and allocated under the global handle rule. Iteration is sequential. Every list element must itself be a legal closed Types & Lexicon value.
- [revise] Check: grammar `check ::= disjunction
disjunction ::= conjunction (OR conjunction)*
conjunction ::= negation (AND negation)*
