GY (grinning):\nLike, maybe it’s a case of the subconscious missing those glory days. Right, Scoob?\n\nSCOOBY (nodding):\nReah, right!\n\nSCRAPPY-DOO:\nOr maybe the villain is a jealous rival from the cat show circuit! \n\nEveryone laughs at SCRAPPY's enthusiasm, the tension momentarily forgotten.\n\nFRED (clapping his hands together):\nAlright, gang, let’s follow these clues and get to the bottom of Aunt Olivia’s nightmares. There’s a mystery to solve!\n\nThe gang scatters in different directions, ready to uncover the truth behind the nighttime feline escapades, their banter and laughter echoing through the mansion as they delve deeper into the Case of the Feline Fantasies.\n\nFade out as we hear SCOOBY and SHAGGY, off-screen, raiding the kitchen, their lighthearted chatter the perfect backdrop to another otherworldly adventure for the Scooby gang.",
